{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1230.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"49d82990d66756f57355b4866b2e132460bd273f0670f761e18bc8dd56bd5c92","ja":"宇宙船サバイバル！","zh":"宇宙飞船求生！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1230.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"45f7da3ffc6e0f693fd4fb78ee053b267fcd00807ce6ccd7bd0154ab59e25261","ja":"今回のお仕事はTV番組の撮影。\nとても過酷な企画に挑戦することになっていて……","zh":"这次的工作是录制电视节目。\n而且还要挑战非常残酷的企划……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1230.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"e017c3724b6055692fab2d9c29c10edb8c0fa00e6393092d066dcb9396193c51","ja":"こんにちは～。『アイドルサバイバルショー！』、\n今回の挑戦者は、私達です～。","zh":"大家好～。《偶像生存秀！》，\n这次的挑战者就是我们哦～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1230.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"69b69e5a11f857045325c33a7fad6dc3dc9138146f07ecaafec87c05b0c9116e","ja":"宇宙旅行を楽しんでいた姫達！　けれど突然の事故で、\n宇宙船に閉じ込められてしまったのです！","zh":"正享受着太空旅行的公主们！然而因为突如其来的事故，\n被困在了宇宙飞船里！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1230.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"91d364de16d9b23b6658bd9c3027dee0c2bb87c9d4e19967fb5dd0ded8cad7ef","ja":"救助が来るまでの1週間……宇宙船の中で生き延びる\nことができれば、チャレンジ達成です。","zh":"只要能在救援到来前的1周内……在宇宙飞船中\n存活下来，即可达成挑战。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1230.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"1a951c1b2d7c1d4a15230b8d70f926ed18ad7b90d8908cdd6a4303500a14a675","ja":"狭い宇宙船のセットの中で、\n宇宙食だけで1週間過ごすのですよ。","zh":"在狭小的宇宙飞船布景中，\n只靠太空食品度过1个星期哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1230.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"c934888cbfe16b4e318ea279af17053a0d729973ba8276825c0f7f9ba88fcbac","ja":"1週間ずーっとみんなと一緒なんだねぇ。\nえへへ♪　なんだかお泊り会みたいだべさ。","zh":"要整整1周都和大家在一起呢。\n嘿嘿♪感觉就像在开过夜派对一样呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1230.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"94737da11e6be3153a436fae4dc0d68a56f845eeddd3cb2253384f367449822a","ja":"そうね！　みんなで楽しく生活していきましょ♪\nそれじゃあみなさん、応援お願いします！","zh":"说得对！大家一起开开心心地生活吧♪\n那么各位，请多多为我们加油哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1230.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"6653e795ced42159ef0426c8396ec54cc6692a4a2ee15b31eb8ac4dac62d5878","ja":"「とても楽しそうに始まったチャレンジ、\n果たして成功するのか！　乞うご期待です！」","zh":"“看似充满乐趣地展开的挑战，\n究竟能否成功呢！敬请期待！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1230.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"79517b633e5f319ae4a38959e2df052e2176e3f7dce1977c631fad30343714e0","ja":"「サバイバル生活、3日目」","zh":"“荒野求生生活，第3天”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1230.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"8b66c307b080354d5700aa22719f385151ce73a948a83588b87d0b152fe6b39d","ja":"はぁ……当たり前だけど、\n今日も宇宙食なのよね……。","zh":"唉……虽然是理所当然的，\n但今天也是吃太空餐呢……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1230.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"6aefc3f480613166777a0dfaa1d21c00c52ab4e0304d6f41e8d03330d045baaf","ja":"種類が限られてるから、さすがに飽きが……。\nうぅ、お酒が恋しいわ……！","zh":"种类很有限，确实都有些吃腻了……\n呜呜，好想喝酒啊……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1230.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"7c1304b7c591217bb5124520f874c4235fb3b4e9767ff788e9eb9da2ba875b04","ja":"あたしも、できたてのご飯とか、新鮮なお野菜が\n食べれないのは、ちょっこしさみしいねぇ……。","zh":"吃不到热腾腾的饭菜和新鲜蔬菜，\n我也觉得有点寂寞呢……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1230.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"566ee830a0b11c7eff60f3154663453b2025e3d4c1c6c141afacd015e5a8f548","ja":"ふたりとも、大丈夫ですか？","zh":"两位都没事吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1230.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"684c81876688501cb713dc42c6e5d917282e7a2b611604ed982e742d69efb8de","ja":"千早ちゃんは、全然余裕みたいね。\nこの生活に不満はないの？　食べ物とか。","zh":"千早看起来挺游刃有余的呢。\n对这种生活没什么不满吗？比如吃的方面。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1230.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"68b1e7f59cfa444f0302b6476d2622e24d6202b98091e305b9e68a58eb6bfdf1","ja":"私は別に……。宇宙食は栄養がしっかり考えられている\nそうですし、むしろとてもありがたいかと。","zh":"我倒无所谓……听说航天食品在营养方面考虑得很充分，\n不如说反而令人很感激呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1230.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"3060fe61653f22646001a7e8e68c464d041a06681b7e5530a5aff7e5d89dbc25","ja":"……そ、そうだね！\nあたしも、千早さんを見習って頑張らねば！","zh":"……也、也是呢！\n我也得以千早小姐为榜样好好努力才行！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
